{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792821360, "covers_from": "2026-10-24T05:56:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-24T05:57:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792821420, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-24T05:56:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 70525, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "我想騎Ubike 的時候，看看周遭Ubike 站，往往都找不到有空閒的車，就算有，車也都是壞的", "display_name": "信義代表 Peter-Consulting", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T05:56:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 70526, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市的市容大概落後首爾20年以上，首爾也曾經破敗不堪但現在已經煥然一新。市長預備如何整頓台北市容？", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.70,526", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T05:56:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36528, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "中山北路下大雨時，快車道積水，汽車通過會噴濺到慢車道，騎車很危險。中山北路面也很不平，大雨也常淹水。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.36,528", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T05:56:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31551, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "文化", "content": "很多偶像都會去高雄，希望市長能優化場館及交通友善度，串聯商圈打造追星應援氛圍，讓台北成為追星首選！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.31,551", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 70526, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.70,526", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 36528, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.36,528", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 31551, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.31,551", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 22984, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name